<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Why was a glove made?</l><l>To have a hand inside it.</l><l>Why was a purse made?</l><l>To have some coins inside it.</l><l>Why was a flower vase made?</l><l>To have some flowers inside it.</l><l>Why were you and I made?</l><l>To have God’s life in us.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
